Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "Orbittal MES Cell Data Service" |
    Select-Object -ExpandProperty Settings |
    Select-Object ExecutionTimeLimit, RestartCount, RestartInterval, MultipleInstances

ExecutionTimeLimit should show PT0S. If it shows P3D, the setting didn't apply — rerun PowerShell elevated.

3. Start them
bat
schtasks /Run /TN "Orbittal MES Cell Data Service"
timeout /t 15
schtasks /Run /TN "Orbittal MES Dashboard"
4. Confirm
bat
schtasks /Query /TN "Orbittal MES Cell Data Service" /V /FO LIST | findstr /C:"Status" /C:"Last Result"

